      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to... its kinda expensive and i've been feeling super stressed lately. could it just be anxiety or like a panic attack? the pain is there but it's not like a crushing feeling, just that weird tearing. maybe i can just take some ibuprofen and wait it out?",
